<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
    <title>{{ title }}</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --ink: #17202a;
        --muted: #64748b;
        --line: #dbe3ea;
        --paper: #ffffff;
        --canvas: #f3f5f7;
        --accent: #a62d26;
        --accent-soft: #fff2ef;
        --teal: #0f766e;
        --teal-soft: #ecfdf5;
        --amber: #a16207;
        --amber-soft: #fffbeb;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--canvas);
        font-family:
          -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei",
          "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }

      a {
        color: #34506f;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .page {
        width: min(1220px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 26px auto 64px;
      }

      .hero {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 42px 46px 36px;
        color: #fff;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background:
          linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(166, 45, 38, 0.97), rgba(88, 25, 28, 0.97)),
          #7b211e;
        box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(71, 27, 27, 0.18);
      }

      .hero::after {
        position: absolute;
        right: -90px;
        top: -115px;
        width: 330px;
        height: 330px;
        border: 55px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        border-radius: 50%;
        content: "";
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
        line-height: 1.18;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }

      .hero-meta {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px 22px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .status {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 7px;
        padding: 3px 10px;
        color: #fff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
        border-radius: 99px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      }

      .status::before {
        width: 7px;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #cbd5e1;
        content: "";
      }

      .status.success::before {
        background: #5ee0ac;
      }

      .status.warning::before {
        background: #fbbf24;
      }

      .status.danger::before {
        background: #fecaca;
      }

      .layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 218px minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: start;
        margin-top: 26px;
      }

      .toc {
        position: sticky;
        top: 22px;
        padding: 19px 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 15px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
      }

      .toc-title {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      }

      .toc a {
        display: block;
        padding: 6px 8px;
        border-left: 2px solid transparent;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .toc a:hover {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-soft);
      }

      main {
        min-width: 0;
      }

      section {
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        padding: 28px 30px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: var(--paper);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(38, 50, 56, 0.04);
      }

      section > h2 {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        font-size: 22px;
        line-height: 1.35;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .section-intro {
        margin: 0 0 22px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .metric-card {
        min-height: 118px;
        padding: 17px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #fbfcfd;
      }

      .metric-label {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .metric-value {
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 760;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .metric-detail {
        margin-top: 7px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .callout {
        margin-top: 18px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: var(--accent-soft);
      }

      .callout h3 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        color: #7f1d1d;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .callout ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }

      .callout.warning {
        border-color: var(--amber);
        background: var(--amber-soft);
      }

      .callout.warning h3 {
        color: #854d0e;
      }

      .method-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .method-card {
        padding: 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
      }

      .method-card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 9px;
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .formula {
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        padding: 10px 11px;
        color: #244257;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #edf4f7;
        font-family: "Cascadia Code", "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .method-detail {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .chart {
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin: 14px 0 4px;
        padding: 8px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #fff;
      }

      .chart svg {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        min-width: 720px;
        height: auto;
      }

      .chart-note {
        margin: 9px 4px 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .table-block {
        margin-top: 22px;
      }

      .table-title-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 9px;
      }

      .table-title-row h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .table-note {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 11px;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .table-scroll {
        overflow-x: auto;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 10px;
      }

      table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      th,
      td {
        padding: 9px 11px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e7ecf0;
        text-align: right;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      th:first-child,
      td:first-child {
        text-align: left;
      }

      th {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        color: #475569;
        background: #f7f9fb;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 750;
      }

      td {
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
        background: #fbfcfd;
      }

      tbody tr:last-child td {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }

      .empty {
        padding: 26px !important;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: center !important;
      }

      details {
        margin-top: 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 11px;
        background: #fff;
      }

      summary {
        padding: 13px 15px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      details .table-block {
        margin: 0 14px 14px;
      }

      .artifact-list {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 8px;
        margin: 14px 0 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .artifact-list li {
        padding: 9px 11px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #f8fafc;
        font-family: "Cascadia Code", Consolas, monospace;
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      footer {
        padding: 20px 10px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 11px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      @media (max-width: 920px) {
        .layout {
          display: block;
        }

        .toc {
          position: static;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
          columns: 2;
        }

        .toc-title {
          column-span: all;
        }

        .cards,
        .method-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .page {
          width: min(100% - 18px, 1220px);
          margin-top: 9px;
        }

        .hero {
          padding: 30px 23px;
          border-radius: 14px;
        }

        section {
          padding: 22px 17px;
        }

        .cards,
        .method-grid,
        .artifact-list {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .toc {
          columns: 1;
        }
      }

      @media print {
        @page {
          size: A4 landscape;
          margin: 12mm;
        }

        body {
          background: #fff;
          font-size: 11px;
        }

        .page {
          width: 100%;
          margin: 0;
        }

        .hero {
          color: #17202a;
          border: 1px solid #adb5bd;
          background: #fff;
          box-shadow: none;
        }

        .hero-meta,
        .eyebrow {
          color: #475569;
        }

        .status {
          color: #17202a;
          border-color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .layout {
          display: block;
          margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .toc {
          display: none;
        }

        section {
          break-inside: avoid;
          box-shadow: none;
        }

        .table-scroll {
          overflow: visible;
        }

        th {
          position: static;
        }

        .chart {
          overflow: visible;
        }

        .chart svg {
          min-width: 0;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    {% macro render_table(table) -%}
      <div class="table-block">
        <div class="table-title-row">
          <h3>{{ table.title }}</h3>
          {% if table.note %}<p class="table-note">{{ table.note }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="table-scroll">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                {% for header in table.headers %}<th scope="col">{{ header }}</th>{% endfor %}
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {% if table.rows %}
                {% for row in table.rows %}
                  <tr>
                    {% for cell in row %}<td>{{ cell }}</td>{% endfor %}
                  </tr>
                {% endfor %}
              {% else %}
                <tr>
                  <td class="empty" colspan="{{ table.headers | length }}">
                    {{ table.empty_message }}
                  </td>
                </tr>
              {% endif %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endmacro %}

    <div class="page">
      <header class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">QuantX · Offline Event Research</p>
        <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span>{{ study_id }} / {{ version }}</span>
          <span>运行标识：{{ run_id }}</span>
          <span>报告时间：{{ generated_at }}</span>
          <span class="status {{ status.class }}">{{ status.label }}</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="layout">
        <nav class="toc" aria-label="报告目录">
          <p class="toc-title">报告目录</p>
          <a href="#summary">01 结论摘要</a>
          <a href="#method">02 研究口径</a>
          <a href="#curves">03 后续走势</a>
          <a href="#comparison">04 正常量对照</a>
          <a href="#interaction">05 条件交互</a>
          <a href="#regression">06 回归分析</a>
          <a href="#robustness">07 稳健性</a>
          <a href="#quality">08 数据质量</a>
          <a href="#reproducibility">09 可复现信息</a>
        </nav>

        <main>
          <section id="summary">
            <h2>结论摘要</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              报告从结构化研究结果生成；摘要用于快速定位信号，不替代分组明细与数据质量检查。
            </p>
            <div class="cards">
              {% for card in summary_cards %}
                <article class="metric-card">
                  <div class="metric-label">{{ card.label }}</div>
                  <div class="metric-value">{{ card.value }}</div>
                  <div class="metric-detail">{{ card.detail }}</div>
                </article>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            <div class="callout">
              <h3>主要观察</h3>
              <ul>
                {% for finding in findings %}<li>{{ finding }}</li>{% endfor %}
              </ul>
            </div>
            {% if warnings %}
              <div class="callout warning">
                <h3>解释限制与运行警告</h3>
                <ul>
                  {% for warning in warnings %}<li>{{ warning }}</li>{% endfor %}
                </ul>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </section>

          <section id="method">
            <h2>研究口径</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              所有条件变量遵守时点可得原则；事件日为 T，事前位置只使用 T−1 及更早数据。
            </p>
            <div class="method-grid">
              {% for item in methodology %}
                <article class="method-card">
                  <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
                  <p class="formula">{{ item.formula }}</p>
                  <p class="method-detail">{{ item.detail }}</p>
                </article>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            <details>
              <summary>查看完整解析配置</summary>
              {{ render_table(config_table) }}
            </details>
          </section>

          <section id="curves">
            <h2>事件后的价格走势</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              比较事件日收盘响应与次日开盘入场收益，并区分绝对收益和基准调整收益。
            </p>
            <div class="chart">{{ event_curve_svg | safe }}</div>
            <p class="chart-note">
              图形直接嵌入 HTML，同时保存在 figures/event_curve.svg。缺失期限不做前向填充。
            </p>
            {{ render_table(event_curve_table) }}
          </section>

          <section id="comparison">
            <h2>异常成交量与正常成交量对照</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              正常量预注册为 0.8 ≤ RVOL20 &lt; 1.2；异常量组只采用配置冷却后事件。
              每个交易日先在相同事前价格位置内做截面等权，再计算异常量减正常量；
              高位减低位的 spread 差是主交互。结果表示历史条件关联，不是因果效应。
            </p>
            {{ render_table(comparison_table) }}
            {% for table in comparison_sensitivity_tables %}
              <details>
                <summary>{{ table.title }}</summary>
                {{ render_table(table) }}
              </details>
            {% endfor %}
          </section>

          <section id="interaction">
            <h2>异常放量与价格位置的条件交互</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              热力图优先展示 T+20，并在可用收益口径中选择有效样本最多的基准。
            </p>
            <div class="chart">{{ heatmap_svg | safe }}</div>
            <p class="chart-note">
              红色表示正收益，青绿色表示负收益；悬停单元格可查看分组与样本数。
            </p>
            {{ render_table(grouped_table) }}
          </section>

          <section id="regression">
            <h2>交互回归</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              主模型使用全 eligible 样本，检验异常量指标、中心化事前价格位置及其交互；
              仅加入事前控制与日期固定效应。交互显著性跨期限和收益口径统一 FDR 校正，
              仍不等同于经济显著或因果关系。
            </p>
            <div class="chart">{{ regression_svg | safe }}</div>
            <p class="chart-note">
              点为系数估计，横线为 {{ confidence_label }}；图形优先选择 T+20 的事件日收盘响应模型。
            </p>
            {{ render_table(regression_table) }}
          </section>

          <section id="robustness">
            <h2>稳健性检查</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              对成交额放大、对数成交量 z-score 和其他配置变体进行对照，检查结论是否依赖单一口径。
            </p>
            {% if robustness_tables %}
              {% for table in robustness_tables %}
                <details{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
                  <summary>{{ table.title }}</summary>
                  {{ render_table(table) }}
                </details>
              {% endfor %}
            {% else %}
              <div class="callout warning">
                <h3>未提供稳健性结果</h3>
                <p>metrics.robustness 为空；本报告不据此推断主结果稳定。</p>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </section>

          <section id="quality">
            <h2>数据质量与样本边界</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              样本覆盖、排除原因与缺失情况决定结论可解释范围，应在阅读收益结果前复核。
            </p>
            {{ render_table(quality_table) }}
          </section>

          <section id="reproducibility">
            <h2>可复现信息</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
              运行清单记录代码状态、配置哈希和数据指纹；结构化结果是报告的事实来源。
            </p>
            {{ render_table(manifest_table) }}
            <h3>本次报告产物</h3>
            <ul class="artifact-list">
              {% for artifact in artifacts %}<li>{{ artifact }}</li>{% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </section>
        </main>
      </div>

      <footer>
        QuantX 离线研究报告 · 仅供研究复核，不构成投资建议 ·
        {{ study_id }} / {{ version }}
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
